  mode m0 frequency 261.401hz decay 0.484577s gain 1.63636 after_decay 1.38157s after_gain 0.08909
  mode m1 frequency 523.024hz decay 0.475367s gain 1.21862 after_decay 1.35531s after_gain 0.0663466
