  mode m23 frequency 2656.02hz decay 0.430777s gain 0.0407745 after_decay 1.22818s after_gain 0.00221992
  mode m24 frequency 2930.09hz decay 0.426683s gain 0.017448 after_decay 1.21651s after_gain 0.000949935
  mode m25 frequency 3206.76hz decay 0.422771s gain 0.00614828 after_decay 1.20536s after_gain 0.000334737
  mode m26 frequency 3486.18hz decay 0.419024s gain 0.0272446 after_decay 1.19467s after_gain 0.0014833
  mode m27 frequency 3768.36hz decay 0.415425s gain 0.0441315 after_decay 1.18441s after_gain 0.00240269
